services.description:
Verified source + ABI — POST.
POST only (GET=405). Requires chainIndex, address. Returns verified multi-file source and ABI.
e.g. POST {"chainIndex":"1","address":"0x..."}

Chain status, gas & stats — POST.
POST only (GET=405). Requires chainIndex. Optional include=[overview,fee,stats]. Returns latest block/gas/stats.
e.g. POST {"chainIndex":"1","include":["fee"]}

Token metadata — POST.
POST only (GET=405). Requires chainIndex, tokenAddress. Returns name, symbol, decimals and total supply.
e.g. POST {"chainIndex":"1","tokenAddress":"0x..."}

Address analytics — POST.
POST only (GET=405). Requires chainIndex, address. Returns activity, counterparties and volume analytics.
e.g. POST {"chainIndex":"1","address":"<addr>"}
